1
00:00:00,730 --> 00:00:03,860
(Leonard:)There are a couple of
things I did with Penny

2
00:00:03,860 --> 00:00:05,230
(Leonard:)that might be a
little silly, but...

3
00:00:05,230 --> 00:00:06,500
(Raj:)Like what?

4
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:10,130
(Leonard:)Every once in a while,
before we'd go to bed,

5
00:00:10,130 --> 00:00:13,070
(Leonard:)I'd put on a little show
for her.

6
00:00:14,740 --> 00:00:16,840
(Raj:)What do you mean
"a show"?

7
00:00:16,840 --> 00:00:21,880
(Leonard:)Well, you know,
the way I took my clothes off.

8
00:00:21,880 --> 00:00:24,180
(Raj:)Like, to music?

9
00:00:24,180 --> 00:00:29,050
(Leonard:)I'd look pretty stupid
if there was no music.

10
00:00:29,050 --> 00:00:31,420
(Raj:)So you'd do
a striptease?

11
00:00:31,420 --> 00:00:35,220
(Leonard:)I wasn't swinging
around a pole.

12
00:00:35,220 --> 00:00:37,520
(Raj:)Good, good.

13
00:00:38,990 --> 00:00:43,000
(Leonard:)There was one time
I put body glitter on.

14
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:45,660
(Raj:)Well, I don't think
you have to worry

15
00:00:45,670 --> 00:00:47,230
(Raj:)about Penny telling
my sister that.

16
00:00:47,230 --> 00:00:48,400
(Leonard:)No, she wouldn't.

17
00:00:48,400 --> 00:00:51,770
(Raj:)Your big problem
is me telling her.

18
00:00:53,340 --> 00:00:55,910
(Leonard:)You really are
a mean little man.

19
00:00:57,110 --> 00:00:59,740
(Priya:)Oh, God, that's so true.

